---@field error? gcp.recommendationengine_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus The error result of the operation in case of failure or cancellation.
---@field metadata? gcp.recommendationengine_v1beta1.DocumentMap Service-specific metadata associated with the operation. It typically contains progress information and common metadata such as create time. Some services might not provide such metadata. Any method that returns a long-running operation should document the metadata type, if any.
---@field done? boolean If the value is `false`, it means the operation is still in progress. If `true`, the operation is completed, and either `error` or `response` is available.

